[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6900.39, "timestamp": "01:55:00", "text": "得到什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6903.91, "timestamp": "01:55:03", "text": "像一滴水。 那个手势。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6906.629, "timestamp": "01:55:06", "text": "你只需说“捏手指下巴”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6910.07, "timestamp": "01:55:10", "text": "捏住手指。 是的。 不是赞德里亚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6912.709, "timestamp": "01:55:12", "text": "来自星空之吻的禅意之吻。 星空披风。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6925.99, "timestamp": "01:55:25", "text": "嘿，我跟你们说实话吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6928.229, "timestamp": "01:55:28", "text": "。 说实话，我永远不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6931.589, "timestamp": "01:55:31", "text": "和V级士兵做朋友"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6932.47, "timestamp": "01:55:32", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6934.39, "timestamp": "01:55:34", "text": "不，不，不。 她现在经济独立了。 她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6939.51, "timestamp": "01:55:39", "text": "好的，终于结束了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6941.51, "timestamp": "01:55:41", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6944.39, "timestamp": "01:55:44", "text": "总之，我们还是回到基什曼吧。 我当时就在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6945.75, "timestamp": "01:55:45", "text": "那儿，她就说：“我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6947.27, "timestamp": "01:55:47", "text": "你是面包吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6949.109, "timestamp": "01:55:49", "text": "她做了个音调手指的动作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6951.51, "timestamp": "01:55:51", "text": "我就想，“哦耶，我就是面包。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6953.35, "timestamp": "01:55:53", "text": "有人在评论里说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6957.189, "timestamp": "01:55:57", "text": "“我希望他不是在面包里。”"}]